FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo9\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">-여권에 날인된 입출국 확인필 사본 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">부 혹은 출입국사실증명원 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo9\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">-연수를 실시한 학교로부터 발행된 수료증명서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 12.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">-연수국가의 문화와 생활 등에 관한 보고서</span><